Subject: [PATCH 12/30] Plugins: their own files through the meter (a2.file)

WebKitGTK 2.54 refuses every file a sandboxed plugin frame asks for from
the plugin scheme; the meter inlines what a page names at the start, but
a page that loads files later (a map's tiles, as they come into view)
got nothing: the Map plugin showed its marks without the map under them.
await a2.file(path) now returns one of the plugin's own files (images and
JSON, up to 8 MB, inside its folder only) as a data: URL, from its window,
its dock tab and its widgets.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
